OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Flargely clear night for most, once any
OL,7,Fdaytime cloud fades or isolated
OL,8,Fcoastal showers ease. Turning cold
OL,9,Fbeneath the cloud-free skies, with
OL,10,Ffrost and the odd patch of fog
OL,11,Fpossible in rural prone spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FAny fog patches slowly
OL,14,Fclearing to leave a bright and largely
OL,15,Fsunny day. The odd shower is possible
OL,16,Falong the coast, but these mostly
OL,17,Fstaying offshore. Cold and breezy
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
