OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFine,
OL,6,Fbut cold Friday with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fwinds easing. Cloud building
OL,8,Fovernight, however some patchy frost
OL,9,Fstill possible. Likely rather cloudy
OL,10,FSaturday and Sunday, but perhaps
OL,11,Fturning less cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
